---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SkillMatrix } from '../../components/SkillMatrix';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="关于我 · junnhwan's blog"
  description="Hi, 我是 junnhwan，专注 AI Agent 产品落地与高性能后端研发。"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 space-y-12">
    <!-- Hero Profile Box -->
    <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl glass-card border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/80 shadow-2xl flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start gap-8">
      <div class="w-24 h-24 sm:w-28 sm:h-28 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500/20 to-blue-600/20 border border-cyan-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400 font-mono font-black text-3xl shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(0,242,254,0.15)] flex-shrink-0">
        JH
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4 text-center md:text-left flex-1">
        <div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-2">
            <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">junnhwan</h1>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-mono bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/20">
              🟢 Active Builder
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-cyan-400 font-mono mt-1">
            AI Agent & Backend Engineer · Shanghai, China
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Hi，我是 <strong>junnhwan</strong>。热爱探索 AI Agent 的工程化落地与高性能后端技术架构。
          坚信「在构建中学习（Learn by Building）」，乐于拆解新机制、复盘面试与技术难点，将每一次认知迭代沉淀在博客中。
        </p>

        <!-- Social Buttons -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-3 pt-2">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/junnhwan"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-white/5 hover:bg-cyan-500/20 text-slate-200 hover:text-cyan-300 text-xs font-medium border border-white/10 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-all"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4"></path>
              <path d="M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>GitHub @junnhwan</span>
          </a>

          <a
            href="/blog"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-slate-300 text-xs font-medium border border-white/10 transition-all"
          >
            <span>阅读技术博客 →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Career & Experience Milestones -->
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">技术经历与实践</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl glass-card bg-slate-950/60 border border-white/5 space-y-2">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">AI Agent 架构探索与 Coding Agent 源码拆解</h3>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">2026</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            深入研究 mini coding agent 的实现机制、Agent Loop 循环控制、Tool Use 函数调用、RAG 检索管道与工程安全防护。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl glass-card bg-slate-950/60 border border-white/5 space-y-2">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Go & Java 企业级后端工程实战</h3>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">2025 - 2026</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            基于 Spring Boot、Redis 分布式缓存与 MySQL 进行高并发外卖点单系统实战，并深入 Go 语言并发与网络编程。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Skills Section -->
    <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl glass-card bg-slate-950/80 border border-white/5">
      <SkillMatrix client:load />
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
